OL,3,GNEWSAHouse closed by police after
OL,4,Abehaviour complaints
OL,5,
OL,6,FA house has been closed by the police
OL,7,Ffollowing multiple complaints about
OL,8,Fanti-social behaviour.
OL,10,FWest Midlands Police said the ongoing
OL,11,Fproblems at the house on Kent Road,
OL,12,FEttingshall, had been "causing worry
OL,13,Fand disruption to local residents with
OL,14,Freports of drug use and disorder being
OL,15,Flinked to the location".
OL,17,FA spokesperson for the force said it
OL,18,Fhad also made a number of arrests.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
