OL,3,GNEWSAHouse closed by police after
OL,4,Abehaviour complaints
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe closure order prohibits anyone
OL,7,Fentering the property for the next
OL,8,Fthree months, unless they are working
OL,9,Ffor the city council, Wolverhampton
OL,10,FHomes or the emergency services.
